  "content": "\n\n<h3><strong>兢<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">II</span> Dust Trench</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a07c57\">Dust Trench 是《Superb Warfare》的輔助模組，以第二次世界大戰為主題。它透過新增裝備與裝甲戰鬥車輛來擴展遊戲內容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">（GitHub）</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">原始碼</span>：<a href=\"https://github.com/StoneEleph/dt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">https://github.com/StoneEleph/dt</span></a></p>",
